Package: gloss
Title: Source Map and Asset Preparation Core for R Figures
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Yonghe", "Xia", email = "xiayh17@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Captures R figures as structured, cross-language source maps and
    portable asset bundles. Instruments graphics device drawing to preserve
    raw and addressable SVG alongside intermediate engine representations
    (data tables, scales, palettes, layer specifications, facet panels, and
    draw-time ordering) and runtime provenance in standard open file formats.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
URL: https://github.com/YuLab-SMU/gloss
